{"UUID":"edcadc6f-512a-4569-94b7-e6be6e8faf22","DebugName":"Covalex_Stanton_Easy_RecoverCargo","Type":"ContractGeneratorHandler_Career","MissionType":{"UUID":"62f92440-202a-43d3-9cb8-b917d4e4a102","Name":"Mercenary"},"MissionGiver":"Covalex Independent Contractors","Title":"Small Covalex Shipment Needs Recovering","TitleKey":"Covalex_RecoverCargo_Easy_Title","Description":"Hiya,\n\nI've got a client who's been messaging me all morning about a shipment they were supposed to receive and when I checked up on the cargo it turns out that it's sitting completely still in the middle of space.\n\nThis is obviously bad for a number of reasons, and not just because I had to spend 20 minutes getting yelled at. Can you head over to <EM4>~mission(Location|Address)</EM4> and see what happened? The original contract called for a ship that could carry <EM4>~mission(MissionMaxSCUSize) cargo containers</EM4> so make sure you've got that and a <EM4>heavy-duty tractor beam</EM4>.\n\nOnce you've got the cargo, can you make sure it's delivered to the freight elevator at <EM4>~mission(Destination|Address)</EM4>? Thanks a bunch.\n\n~mission(Contractor|SignOff)\n\nElla Tieno \nJr. Logistics Coordinator \nCovalex Shipping   \n'Anything you need, anywhere you need it.' \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCovalex Shipping is a limited liability corporation. To encourage timely deliveries and prevent fraud on cargo hauls, Covalex Shipping will set a delivery time limit and upon expiration, any undelivered cargo will be considered stolen and treated as such. Total payment will be prorated according to the percentage of cargo successfully delivered.","DescriptionKey":"Covalex_RecoverCargo_Easy_Description","DisplayDescription":"Hiya,\n\nI've got a client who's been messaging me all morning about a shipment they were supposed to receive and when I checked up on the cargo it turns out that it's sitting completely still in the middle of space.\n\nThis is obviously bad for a number of reasons, and not just because I had to spend 20 minutes getting yelled at. Can you head over to <EM4>[Location|Address]</EM4> and see what happened? The original contract called for a ship that could carry <EM4>32 SCU cargo containers</EM4> so make sure you've got that and a <EM4>heavy-duty tractor beam</EM4>.\n\nOnce you've got the cargo, can you make sure it's delivered to the freight elevator at <EM4>[Destination|Address]</EM4>? Thanks a bunch.\n\n[Contractor|SignOff]\n\nElla Tieno \nJr. Logistics Coordinator \nCovalex Shipping   \n'Anything you need, anywhere you need it.' \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCovalex Shipping is a limited liability corporation. To encourage timely deliveries and prevent fraud on cargo hauls, Covalex Shipping will set a delivery time limit and upon expiration, any undelivered cargo will be considered stolen and treated as such. Total payment will be prorated according to the percentage of cargo successfully delivered.","LocationPools":{"MissionLocationBP":{"Purpose":"Location","ResolvedLocations":[{"UUID":"796cf4f2-4f5e-4b15-af07-2b06cdb2c86b","LocationTemplateUUID":"796cf4f2-4f5e-4b15-af07-2b06cdb2c86b","Name":"Cutlass wreck site"},{"UUID":"8354fefe-3e5d-4dd5-8d15-0347bded2503","LocationTemplateUUID":"8354fefe-3e5d-4dd5-8d15-0347bded2503","Name":"Starfarer wreck site"},{"UUID":"59015c13-53a6-49d5-93f3-e5fd8fe93c77","LocationTemplateUUID":"59015c13-53a6-49d5-93f3-e5fd8fe93c77","Name":"Freelancer wreck site"},{"UUID":"8d66d728-26ed-4721-b323-4ec2e1a7a11a","LocationTemplateUUID":"8d66d728-26ed-4721-b323-4ec2e1a7a11a","Name":"Constellation wreck site"},{"UUID":"a0af0b8d-5a76-4a30-bf21-b94dc8c7b240","LocationTemplateUUID":"a0af0b8d-5a76-4a30-bf21-b94dc8c7b240","Name":"Caterpillar wreck site"}],"ResourceTags":[{"UUID":"6804b0a9-b01d-4c9a-8063-67784bd0f021","Name":"KillExclusive"}]},"DropOffLocationBP":{"Purpose":"Destination","ResolvedLocations":[{"UUID":"628c647c-55d0-46e8-87d2-c9200eb65986","LocationTemplateUUID":"628c647c-55d0-46e8-87d2-c9200eb65986"},{"UUID":"f02847ac-b892-4349-b8b5-6f